<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <h1>SEO Gap Brief Builder</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        Turn a rough keyword, audience, angle, and competitor notes into editable cards for content gaps, outline angles, metadata, FAQs, claim checks, and a copy-ready brief.
      </p>
    </header>

    <nav class="topbar" aria-label="Tool sections">
      <a href="#inputs">Inputs</a>
      <a href="#gaps">Gap map</a>
      <a href="#outline">Outline</a>
